+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Requests summaries for the authenticated user on this connection. The server MUST take the user id from the authenticated connection, ignore any user id in the frame, and answer with a `conversation_list` whose summary times are ISO strings ([validated by: answers the authenticated user with their own summaries on the wire](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L10)).
+
